##Notes##
// Profil OpenPPL d'exemple : joueur serré (nit) pour Spin & Go.

##f$preflop##
// Ouvertures / relances : uniquement les meilleures mains
WHEN StackSize <= 8 AND handrank169 <= 40 RaiseMax FORCE
WHEN Raises = 0 AND handrank169 <= 24 RaiseTo 3 FORCE
WHEN Raises = 0 AND InSmallBlind AND handrank169 <= 40 RaiseTo 3 FORCE
WHEN Raises = 0 AND InBigBlind Check FORCE
WHEN Raises >= 1 AND handrank169 <= 8 RaiseTo 9 FORCE
WHEN Raises >= 1 AND handrank169 <= 18 Call FORCE
WHEN Others Fold FORCE

##f$flop##
WHEN prwin > 0.80 RaiseThreeFourthPot FORCE
WHEN prwin > 0.62 RaiseHalfPot FORCE
WHEN prwin > 0.50 Call FORCE
WHEN Others Check FORCE

##f$turn##
WHEN prwin > 0.82 RaiseThreeFourthPot FORCE
WHEN prwin > 0.60 Call FORCE
WHEN Others Check FORCE

##f$river##
WHEN prwin > 0.85 RaiseMax FORCE
WHEN prwin > 0.70 RaiseHalfPot FORCE
WHEN prwin > 0.58 Call FORCE
WHEN Others Check FORCE
